This vendor directory hosts the build recipe for ``ados_vins_fusion_shim``,
an executable that links against the VINS-Fusion estimator from the
HKUST Aerial Robotics Group
(https://github.com/HKUST-Aerial-Robotics/VINS-Fusion). VINS-Fusion is
licensed under GPL-3.0; the binary built from this directory
inherits those terms.

The verbatim text of the GNU General Public License v3 is available
at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt and is also distributed
as the LICENSE file in the VINS-Fusion upstream repository.

This file points to the canonical text rather than embedding it in
full so the licence stays in sync with upstream. The plugin install
flow surfaces the VINS-Fusion attribution at the install-confirmation
dialog (via the manifest's vendor_attribution block) so operators
acknowledge the GPL-3.0 terms before the binary executes.

The Altnautica-authored adapter code in this directory (CMakeLists,
main.cpp, ipc_channel.{hpp,cpp}, shm_ring.{hpp,cpp}, BUILD.md) is
itself GPL-3.0-or-later, matching the plugin's overall licence.
